# Official Server Model Benchmark & Release Report

**Matchup `001_001` (Kamen Rider Ichigo vs. Kamen Rider Ichigo Mirror)**

**Candidate Checkpoint Fingerprint:** `3710643395`

**Engine Build:** `v5-state256-action17`

**Deployment Target:** `data/models/001_001.json`

---

## 1. Executive Summary & Clearance Status

Candidate Model **`3710643395`** has officially passed all validation tiers, exceeding the mandatory **> 50.0% win rate** requirement across Easy, Balanced, and SOUL AI difficulty settings.

By integrating the updated **Guard Chi-Reward System** ($\lfloor 0.5 \times \text{chiCost} \rfloor + 1$), Candidate `3710643395` resolves legacy mirror match bottlenecks, achieving a **68.0% win rate against SOUL AI** under `RIDER` live search and a **53.8% direct network baseline against Balanced AI**.

```
  =============================================================================
   DIFFICULTY TIER       POLICY MODE      WIN RATE     SAMPLE     STATUS
  =============================================================================
   EASY                 network (Direct)   70.0%       80 Games   PASSED
   BALANCED             network (Direct)   53.8%       80 Games   PASSED
   SOUL                 rider (Live Search) 68.0%       25 Games   PASSED
  =============================================================================

```

---

## 2. Complete Cross-Tier Evaluation Matrix

| Metric / Parameter | EASY Tier (`network`) | BALANCED Tier (`network`) | SOUL Tier (`rider` search) | Diagnostic Impact |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Win Rate** | **70.0%** (56W / 24L) | **53.8%** (43W / 37L) | **68.0%** (17W / 8L) | **Clear Sweep:** Holds positive win margin across all tiers |
| **Average Round Duration** | 12.6 rounds | 12.9 rounds | **17.5 rounds** | **Controlled Pacing:** Search extends match length to find punish windows |
| **Execution Speed** | 462.2 matches/min | 603.6 matches/min | 1.8 matches/min | Fast direct matrix inference vs deep Expectimax lookahead |
| **Mean Selected $Q$** | `0.7448` | `0.6714` | **`0.6962`** | Stable value distribution |
| **P1 / P2 Balance** | P1: 29W / P2: 27W | P1: 22W / P2: 21W | Symmetrical execution | Zero side bias detected |

---

## 3. Stance & Action Usage Breakdown

```
        STANCE DISTRIBUTION ACROSS TIERS (Action Shares)

   EASY     [W: 1.1%] [A: 2.9%] [S: 52.6%] [D: 40.1%] [IDLE: 3.4%]
   BALANCED [W: 0.4%] [A: 1.8%] [S: 53.1%] [D: 39.9%] [IDLE: 4.8%]
   SOUL     [W: 2.0%] [A: 3.4%] [S: 34.5%] [D: 56.9%] [IDLE: 3.2%]

```

### Stance Details (SOUL Tier — 441 Round Decisions)

1. **`D` Stance — Neutral Control (56.9% / 251 Decisions):**
* **`D+L` (Combo Punch / Poke):** 138 uses (55.0% of pokes) — Primary low-risk neutral harassment.
* **`D+J` (Standard Jab):** 58 uses — Frame trap initiator.
* **`D+K` (Low Sweep):** 40 uses — Spacing reset.
* **`D+I` (Rider Whip Poke):** 15 uses — Mid-range meter generator.


2. **`S` Stance — Special Punishes & Finisher Cash-Outs (34.5% / 152 Decisions):**
* **`S+J` (Rider Chop / Kick):** **115 uses (75.7% of all specials)** — Core execution choice for punishing enemy special startup/recovery.
* **`S+I` (Kirimomi Kick):** 25 uses — High-cost heavy damage cash-out.
* **`S+L` (Rider Kick):** 9 uses.
* **`S+K` (X-Chop variant):** 3 uses.


3. **`A` Stance — Defensive Omni Guard (3.4% / 15 Decisions):**
* **`A+I` (Windmill Omni Guard):** **14 uses (93.3% of all guards)**.
* **`A+J` (High Block):** 1 use.


4. **`W` Stance — Utility & LP Sustain (2.0% / 9 Decisions):**
* **`W+L` (Kaizorg Vitality Recovery):** 7 uses — Tactical healing during distance resets.
* **`W+K` (Utility stance):** 2 uses.



---

## 4. Key Tactical & Engine Insights

### 1. `A+I` Windmill Guard Optimization (93.3% Guard Share)

Under the updated Guard Chi-reward system ($\lfloor 0.5 \times \text{chiCost} \rfloor + 1$), blocking an opponent's 3-Chi Windmill or 6-Chi Special returns **+2 to +4 Chi**. The retrained Q-weights correctly treat `A+I` as a net Chi generator, allowing `RIDER` live search to time `A+I` during opponent attack windups and immediately counter-attack.

### 2. Adaptive Policy Scaling

* **Low-Tier Suppression (Easy / Balanced):** The direct matrix dumps **> 52% of actions into `S` stance specials**, overpowering non-punishing opponents in ~12.7 rounds.
* **High-Tier Calculation (SOUL):** Under deep search, the model shifts **56.9% of turns into `D` stance neutral pokes**, storing Chi for 115 `S+J` punish strikes and 7 `W+L` vitality casts.

---

